stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Loading
  Loading: Loading comparable terms
  Ready: Confirmed comparison
  Invalid: Comparison unavailable, filters usable
  Disposed: Comparison closed
  Loading --> Ready: Current valid response
  Loading --> Invalid: Current malformed response or failed read
  Invalid --> Loading: Submit Compare to retry
  Ready --> Loading: Submit filters or refresh
  Loading --> Loading: Submit newer filters
  Loading --> Loading: Ignore stale response
  Ready --> Ready: Ignore stale response
  Invalid --> Invalid: Ignore stale response
  Loading --> Disposed: Leave workspace
  Ready --> Disposed: Leave workspace
  Invalid --> Disposed: Leave workspace
  Disposed --> Disposed: Ignore pending response
  %% never Show malformed rows as economic evidence
  %% never Replace current results with stale replies
